<SiteLayout title="Return Policy | Coding Machine Store" description="3-month warranty on coding machines from M. H. S. City. If a machine does not run, we ship replacement parts free of charge.">
  <section class="category-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Return Policy</span><h1>Return Policy.</h1><p>Every machine from M. H. S. City is covered by a 3-month warranty from the delivery date. If a machine does not run, we send the replacement parts — free of charge.</p></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">3-month warranty</span><h2>If your machine does not run, we fix it with free parts.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Within 3 months of the delivery date, if a machine does not run or does not work, we ship the replacement parts to you free of charge — the parts and their shipping are free — so you can replace the faulty part and get the machine running again.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">How to claim</span><h2>Send us the order details and a video or photo.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@codingmachinestore.com">info@codingmachinestore.com</a> or send a message through the <a class="text-link" href="/#quote">quote form</a>, with your order details and a short video or photo showing the problem. We will send the replacement parts.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:info@codingmachinestore.com">Email info@codingmachinestore.com</a><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Continue browsing products ↓</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
